Household Calendar SMS Signup
---

Household Calendar is a private SMS calendar assistant for invited household members. It provides conversational calendar assistance, event confirmations, updates, and reminders.

To subscribe, text START to (980) 825-4986.

Message frequency varies based on your requests and calendar activity. Message and data rates may apply. Reply STOP to unsubscribe or HELP for assistance. Consent is not a condition of purchase.

